                <pb facs="0590" n="510" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg510"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr. Raikes.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-08-06"><hi rendition="#italic">August 6,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Navy Department hears from commander of <hi rendition="#italic">Ranger</hi> at
                    Panama that he is informed the Colombian Government contemplates seizing the
                    British steamer <hi rendition="#italic">Quito</hi>. I communicate this for your
                    information.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvey A. Adee</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
